recommend check-in (Keaton) -- three words wanted, all standing from the elder lap and none of them blocking: whether fleet_call is seated as the fleet's only signal, with 2 pkill sites left to adopt; the star's 4.79 against its 10.6x repair; and whether a lap may tool the shelf sort after twelve hand repairs of %440. The dialect repair needs no ruling -- it is landed and GREEN -- yet the readlink ratchet's honest floor of three is a reader's judgment a scan cannot make, and it is written on the pin so the next hand does not ratchet toward a zero that would delete a proof.
